I was never a huge fan of Hack and shash games until I tried this one.
Pros:
- Beautiful world, with a lot to explore and little details to admire;
- The combat is flashy and satisfating;
- Different classes with a lot of customization;
- There are a lot of different enemies;
- Support Mods;
- Can play online or with friends.
Cons:
- Story is pretty weak;
- Voice acting is bad.
Final Verdic: 8.5/10
This game is incredibly fun and it's worth its money.

