One of the best free games on Steam. It's a simple puzzle platformer - I don't like platforming generally, but it's unintrusive here. The art & sound design are both calming and gorgeous, and it's short. What more could you want? I foresee myself replaying this a lot over the years when I need something to chill to.
Especially recommended if you're a fan of Superbrothers S&S (somewhat similar design-wise), Journey (similar in themes
), or the "weird RPGmaker" (read: Yume Nikki-influenced) scene.
